    "name": "Nondegenerate two-layer observable and response-law witness",
    "construction": "Set \\(L=2\\), \\(\\kappa=49/100\\), and define the observable arm-cell table \\[v^{\\mathrm{ex}}=\\begin{array}{c|ccccc}&0^{\\star}&(1,0)&(1,1)&(2,0)&(2,1)\\\\\\hline z=0&2/5&1/20&3/10&1/20&1/5\\\\z=1&1/5&7/20&1/10&21/100&7/50\\end{array}.\\] Thus \\(r=(2/5,7/20,1/4)\\), \\(c=(1/5,9/20,7/20)\\), \\(q_0=(3/10,1/5)\\), and \\(q_1=(1/10,7/50)\\). Construct \\(\\Gamma^-\\) and \\(\\Gamma^+\\) on the admissible expanded-state arcs by \\[\\begin{array}{c|cc}\\text{arc}&\\Gamma^-&\\Gamma^+\\\\\\hline 0^{\\star}\\to0^{\\star}&1/5&1/5\\\\0^{\\star}\\to(1,0)&1/5&1/20\\\\0^{\\star}\\to(1,1)&0&1/10\\\\0^{\\star}\\to(2,1)&0&1/20\\\\(1,0)\\to(1,0)&1/20&0\\\\(1,0)\\to(2,1)&0&1/20\\\\(1,1)\\to(1,0)&1/10&3/10\\\\(1,1)\\to(1,1)&1/10&0\\\\(1,1)\\to(2,0)&1/10&0\\\\(2,0)\\to(2,0)&1/20&1/100\\\\(2,0)\\to(2,1)&0&1/25\\\\(2,1)\\to(2,0)&3/50&1/5\\\\(2,1)\\to(2,1)&7/50&0\\end{array}.\\] Every omitted arc has zero mass; the decoder in \\(\\mathrm{lem{:}expanded\\mbox{-}network\\mbox{-}decoder}\\) completes unused potential outcomes by zero.",
